  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0-rc.1 ships out-of-core columnar SSTables (format v8 with zone maps and delete vectors), compact in-memory FlatRowStore, typed SQL scan, join, GROUP BY and bounded top-k execution with UTF-8 byte filtering, HNSW SQL options (WITH) and diversity heuristic defaults, cost-based filtered vector exact-scan routing, eager-optimized SIMD distance kernels, and BIT/culture correctness fixes.",
